    "chunk_text": "in ymbe \u00f0a burh, \u00e6lce d\u00e6ge \u00e6ne. & o\u00f0re seofon blewon mid sylfrenum byman. & hi ealle to fyrdwicon ferdon \u00e6fter \u00f0am. On \u00f0am seofo\u00f0an d\u00e6ge hi ferdon seofon si\u00f0on ymb \u00f0a burh. & on \u00f0am seofo\u00f0an ymbf\u00e6relde, \u00f0a \u00f0a sacerdas blewon, & \u00f0\u00e6t folc eall hrymde, swa swa Iosue him Iosue \u00f0a clypode, & cw\u00e6\u00f0 to \u00f0am folce: Sy \u00f0eos burh amansumod & eall \u00f0\u00e6t bi\u00f0 on hyre, buton Swa hw\u00e6t swa her goldes by\u00f0, \u00f0\u00e6t beo Gode gehalgod, & on seolfre o\u00f0\u00f0e on are, eall in to his Hi ofslogon \u00f0a sona mid swurdes ecge weras & wifmen & \u00f0a wepende cild, hry\u00f0era & scep, assan & Iosue cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00f0a sy\u00f0\u00f0an to \u00f0am fores\u00e6dum \u00e6rendracum: Ga\u00f0 nu to \u00f0am huse, \u00f0\u00e6r ge behydde w\u00e6ron, Hy dydon \u00f0a swa swa him gedihte Iosue, & l\u00e6ddon hi of \u00f0\u00e6re byrig mid eallum hyre magum, & hi Hi forb\u00e6rndon \u00f0a \u00f0a burh & \u00f0\u00e6t \u00f0e binnan hyre w\u00e6s. & Iosue b\u00e6d \u00f0us: Beo se awyrged, \u00f0e \u00e6fre eft geedsta\u00f0elie \u00f0as buruh Hiericho. God w\u00e6s \u00f0a mid Iosue on eallum his weorcum, & his nama wear\u00f0 gewidm\u00e6rsod wide geond \u00f0\u00e6t WITODLICE Achar, Charmies sunu, Zabdies suna, Zares suna, of Iudan m\u00e6",
